# SEC-004: vendored third-party bundles under libs/ are integrity-checked by
# SHA-384 SRI hash (see scripts/download-libs.js) against their pristine
# upstream bytes. Git's core.autocrlf was silently rewriting LF to CRLF on
# checkout for these files (no override existed before this), which broke
# libs/jspdf.umd.min.js's hash without changing a single character of code.
# Treat them as binary so line endings are never touched, regardless of the
# local core.autocrlf setting.
libs/* -text
